"function parsePrompt(text){text=String(text||'').trim();if(!text){return null;}let kind='stand';if(/翻跟斗|翻滚|打滚/.test(text))kind='flip';else if(/原地.*左.*旋|左.*原地.*旋|原地左转|左旋|左自转|左转圈/.test(text))kind='spin_left';else if(/原地.*右.*旋|右.*原地.*旋|原地右转|右旋|右自转|右转圈/.test(text))kind='spin_right';else if(/握手/.test(text))kind=/左前|左手|左/.test(text)?'shake_left':'shake_right';else if(/招手|挥手/.test(text))kind=/左前|左手|左/.test(text)?'wave_left':'wave_right';else if(/发球|网球/.test(text))kind=/左前|左手|左/.test(text)?'serve_left':'serve_right';else if(/校正|初始化|校正位置|装配位|伸直/.test(text))kind='init';else if(/前进|走/.test(text))kind='walk';else if(/后退|后撤/.test(text))kind='back';else if(/左转/.test(text))kind='left';else if(/右转/.test(text))kind='right';else if(/点头/.test(text))kind='nod';else if(/摆|摇/.test(text))kind='swing';else if(/趴|低/.test(text))kind='down';else if(/站立|站好|站起来|站立模式|回站立|站立复位|回正|回中|归中|归位|复位/.test(text))kind='stand';const appendStand=/回站立|站立复位|回正|回中|归中|归位|复位/.test(text)&&kind!=='stand';const stepMatch=text.match(/(\\d+)\\s*步/);const secondMatch=text.match(/(\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)\\s*秒/);const ampMatch=text.match(/(\\d+)\\s*度/);let speed=/慢|slow/.test(text)?'slow':(/快|fast/.test(text)?'fast':'normal');let steps=stepMatch?Number(stepMatch[1]):Number(qs('genSteps').value||5);let amp=ampMatch?Number(ampMatch[1]):Number(qs('genAmp').value||18);if(secondMatch){steps=estimateStepsFromSeconds(kind,speed,Number(secondMatch[1]));}if(/小摆幅|轻微|柔和/.test(text))amp=Math.min(amp,12);if(/大摆幅|夸张|用力/.test(text))amp=Math.max(amp,24);return {kind,speed,steps,amp,pause:Number(qs('genPause').value||0),seconds:secondMatch?Number(secondMatch[1]):0,appendStand};}\n"
"function loadFrames(frames,append){if(!append){state.frames=frames.length?frames:[defaultFrame('frame-1')];state.selected=0;}else{state.frames=state.frames.concat(frames);}renderAll();}\n"
"function generateFromControls(){const kind=qs('genKind').value;const speed=qs('genSpeed').value;const steps=clamp(qs('genSteps').value,1,32);const amp=clamp(qs('genAmp').value,6,36);const pause=clamp(qs('genPause').value,0,1000);state.generated=generateSequence(kind,speed,steps,amp,pause);loadFrames(state.generated,false);setOut('已按参数生成关键帧草稿');}\n"
"function generateFromPrompt(){const parsed=parsePrompt(qs('promptText').value);if(!parsed){setOut('请输入描述后再生成');return;}state.generated=generateSequence(parsed.kind,parsed.speed,parsed.steps,parsed.amp,parsed.pause);if(parsed.appendStand){state.generated=state.generated.concat(generateSequence('stand',parsed.speed,1,parsed.amp,0));}loadFrames(state.generated,false);qs('genKind').value=parsed.kind;qs('genSpeed').value=parsed.speed;qs('genSteps').value=parsed.steps;qs('genAmp').value=parsed.amp;refreshTemplateForm();setOut(parsed.appendStand?`已按文本生成关键帧草稿，并在结尾追加回站立（${state.generated.length} 帧）`:parsed.seconds?`已按文本生成关键帧草稿（约 ${parsed.seconds} 秒，展开为 ${parsed.steps} 步）`:'已按文本生成关键帧草稿');}\n"
"function appendGenerated(){const parsed=parsePrompt(qs('promptText').value)||{kind:qs('genKind').value,speed:qs('genSpeed').value,steps:clamp(qs('genSteps').value,1,32),amp:clamp(qs('genAmp').value,6,36),pause:clamp(qs('genPause').value,0,1000),appendStand:false};let frames=generateSequence(parsed.kind,parsed.speed,parsed.steps,parsed.amp,parsed.pause);if(parsed.appendStand){frames=frames.concat(generateSequence('stand',parsed.speed,1,parsed.amp,0));}loadFrames(frames,true);setOut(parsed.appendStand?'已把生成结果追加到当前序列，并在结尾追加回站立':'已把生成结果追加到当前序列');}\n"
"async function runTemplateNow(){const kind=qs('genKind').value;const speed=qs('genSpeed').value||'normal';const steps=clamp(qs('genSteps').value,1,32);generateFromControls();if(shouldRunViaNative(kind)){await runNamedAction(kind,steps,speed);return;}await sendSequence('all');}\n"
"async function runPromptNow(){const text=String(qs('promptText').value||'').trim();if(!text){setOut('请输入描述后再运行');return;}const parsed=parsePrompt(text);generateFromPrompt();if(parsed&&shouldRunViaNative(parsed.kind)){await runNamedAction(parsed.kind,parsed.steps,parsed.speed||'normal');return;}await sendSequence('all');}\n"
"async function queryStatus(){try{const res=await fetch('/api/dog/status');const data=await res.json();state.status=data;if(data&&data.ready&&data.current){state.meta=Object.assign({},state.meta||{}, {ready:true,current:data.current});renderAll();}setOut(data);}catch(err){setOut('查询失败: '+err);}}\n"
"async function refreshDeviceMeta(){try{const res=await fetch('/api/dog/meta');const data=await res.json();if((!data||!data.ready)&&state.meta&&state.meta.ready){data.ready=true;data.current=data.current||state.meta.current;}const shouldResetHome=!state.frames.length||(state.frames.length===1&&state.frames[0]&&(state.frames[0].name==='home'||state.frames[0].name==='stand'));state.meta=data;state.status=Object.assign({},state.status||{}, {ready:data.ready,current:data.current});applySliderMeta();if(shouldResetHome){clearToHome();}else{renderAll();}setOut('设备元数据已刷新');}catch(err){setOut('读取设备元数据失败: '+err);}}\n"
"function loadCurrentPoseFrame(){const abs=(state.meta&&state.meta.current&&state.meta.current.abs)||defaultStandPose();state.frames=[{name:'device-current',s:{lf:abs.lf,rf:abs.rf,lr:abs.lr,rr:abs.rr},v:300,d:0}];state.selected=0;renderAll();setOut('已载入设备当前姿态');}\n"
"async function showControlPageHint(){try{const res=await fetch('/api/dog/show_page');const data=await res.json();setOut(data);}catch(err){setOut('屏幕显示地址失败: '+err);}}\n"
"async function sendSequence(scope){scope=scope||getExecutionScope();const frames=getExecutionFrames(scope);const text=JSON.stringify(buildSequenceObject(frames));const bodyBytes=(new Blob([text])).size;const bodyMax=Number(state.meta&&state.meta.sequence_body_max||0);if(bodyMax>0&&bodyBytes>bodyMax){setOut(`发送失败: ${getExecutionScopeLabel(scope)}共 ${frames.length} 帧，JSON 大小 ${bodyBytes} bytes，超过设备上限 ${bodyMax} bytes。请减少帧数，或合并相邻静止帧。`);return;}try{const res=await fetch('/api/dog/sequence',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:text});const raw=await res.text();let data;try{data=raw?JSON.parse(raw):{ok:res.ok,status:res.status};}catch(_err){data={ok:res.ok,status:res.status,body:raw};}if(!res.ok){setOut(data&&data.msg?`发送失败: ${data.msg}${data.body_max?` (body ${bodyBytes}/${data.body_max} bytes)`:''}`:`发送失败: HTTP ${res.status}`);return;}setOut(typeof data==='object'&&data?Object.assign({scope:getExecutionScopeLabel(scope),frames:frames.length},data):data);}catch(err){setOut(`发送失败: ${err}；${getExecutionScopeLabel(scope)} ${frames.length} 帧，JSON ${bodyBytes} bytes${bodyMax>0?`，设备上限 ${bodyMax} bytes`:''}`);}}\n"
"function stopPreview(){if(state.playTimer){clearTimeout(state.playTimer);state.playTimer=null;}}\n"
"function playPreview(scope){stopPreview();scope=scope||getExecutionScope();const sourceFrames=getExecutionFrames(scope);if(!sourceFrames.length)return;const baseIndex=state.selected;let idx=0;const tick=()=>{if(scope==='all'){state.selected=idx;renderAll();}else{const f=sourceFrames[0];qs('modelText').textContent=`当前预览: ${getExecutionScopeLabel(scope)} | ${f.name||'frame'} | 逻辑角: LF ${absToLogical(f.s.lf,'lf')} / RF ${absToLogical(f.s.rf,'rf')} / LR ${absToLogical(f.s.lr,'lr')} / RR ${absToLogical(f.s.rr,'rr')}`;JOINT_KEYS.forEach(k=>setSliderPair(k,f.s[k]));}const f=sourceFrames[idx];if(scope==='current'){const prev=state.frames[state.selected];state.frames[state.selected]=deepCopy(f);renderDogModel();renderThreeDog();state.frames[state.selected]=prev;idx=0;}else{idx=(idx+1)%sourceFrames.length;}state.playTimer=setTimeout(tick,Math.max(40,(f.v||300)+(f.d||0)));};tick();setOut(`开始预览：${getExecutionScopeLabel(scope)}（${sourceFrames.length} 帧）`);if(scope==='current'){state.selected=baseIndex;}}\n"
"initThreePreview();bindFrameInputs();bindTemplateInputs();bindModelDragging();clearToHome();refreshTemplateForm();refreshDeviceMeta();queryStatus();\n"
"</script>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
